Pr lang="en-US" sz="1050" i="1" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="F4E9D8"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Calibri" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Calibri" pitchFamily="34" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="Calibri" pitchFamily="34" charset="-120"/></a:rPr><a:t>Plain English: OSRM often gives very similar alternates. Our trick is perpendicular via-points: we take the midpoint from A to B, shift it sideways with fixed offsets (about 0.015 and 0.030 degrees), and force OSRM through those points. Result: clearly different corridors we can compare for safety.</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="1050" dirty="0"/></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="14" name="Shape 11"></p:cNvPr><p:cNvSpPr/><p:nvPr></p:nvPr></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="6355080" y="4434840"/><a:ext cx="5349240" cy="1874520"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst></a:avLst></a:prstGeom><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="121C3A"/></a:solidFill><a:ln w="9525"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="2A3A6E"/></a:solidFill><a:prstDash val="solid"/></a:ln></p:spPr></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="15" name="Shape 12"></p:cNvPr><p:cNvSpPr/><p:nvPr></p:nvPr></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="6355080" y="4434840"/><a:ext cx="64008" cy="1874520"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst></a:avLst></a:prstGeom><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="C8F751"/></a:solidFill><a:ln w="12700"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="C8F751"/></a:solidFill><a:prstDash val="solid"/></a:ln></p:spPr></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="16" name="Text 13"></p:cNvPr><p:cNvSpPr/><p:nvPr></p:nvPr></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="6583680" y="4544568"/><a:ext cx="5029200" cy="274320"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst></a:avLst></a:prstGeom><a:noFill/><a:ln></a:ln></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr wrap="square" lIns="0" tIns="0" rIns="0" bIns="0" rtlCol="0" anchor="ctr"></a:bodyPr><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:pPr indent="0" marL="0"><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1000" b="1" spc="400" kern="0" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="C8F751"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Calibri" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Calibri" pitchFamily="34" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="Calibri" pitchFamily="34" charset="-120"/></a:rPr><a:t>THE SCORE</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="1000" dirty="0"/></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="17" name="Text 14"></p:cNvPr><p:cNvSpPr/><p:nvPr></p:nvPr></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="6583680" y="4846320"/><a:ext cx="5029200" cy="365760"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst></a:avLst></a:prstGeom><a:noFill/><a:ln></a:ln></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr wrap="square" lIns="0" tIns="0" rIns="0" bIns="0" rtlCol="0" anchor="ctr"></a:bodyPr><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:pPr indent="0" marL="0"><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" b="1" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="FFFFFF"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Consolas" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Consolas" pitchFamily="34" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="Consolas" pitchFamily="34" charset="-120"/></a:rPr><a:t>overall_risk = 0.7 × avg_risk + 0.3 × max_risk</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" dirty="0"/></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="18" name="Text 15"></p:cNvPr><p:cNvSpPr/><p:nvPr></p:nvPr></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="6583680" y="5212080"/><a:ext cx="5029200" cy="365760"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst></a:avLst></a:prstGeom><a:noFill/><a:ln></a:ln></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr wrap="square" lIns="0" tIns="0" rIns="0" bIns="0" rtlCol="0" anchor="ctr"></a:bodyPr><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:pPr indent="0" marL="0"><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" b="1" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="F5A524"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Consolas" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Consolas" pitchFamily="34" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="Consolas" pitchFamily="34" charset="-120"/></a:rPr><a:t>If is_night (8pm – 6am):  score × 0.85</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" dirty="0"/></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="19" name="Text 16"></p:cNvPr><p:cNvSpPr/><p:nvPr></p:nvPr></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="6583680" y="5623560"/><a:ext cx="5029200" cy="640080"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst></a:avLst></a:prstGeom><a:noFill/><a:ln></a:ln></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr wrap="square" lIns="0" tIns="0" rIns="0" bIns="0" rtlCol="0" anchor="ctr"></a:bodyPr><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:pPr indent="0" marL="0"><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="950" i="1" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="9AA8C7"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Calibri" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Calibri" pitchFamily="34" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="Calibri" pitchFamily="34" charset="-120"/></a:rPr><a:t>70% on average risk rewards consistently safer corridors; 30% on the worst point penalises one dangerous hotspot. At night (8pm-6am), scores get the night factor so the safest route can differ from daytime.</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="950" dirty="0"/></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="20" name="Text 17"></p:cNvPr><p:cNvSpPr/><p:nvPr></p:nvPr></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="457200" y="6492240"/><a:ext cx="7315200" cy="274320"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst></a:avLst></a:prstGeom><a:noFill/><a:ln></a:ln></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr wrap="square" lIns="0" tIns="0" rIns="0" bIns="0" rtlCol="0" anchor="ctr"></a:bodyPr><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:pPr indent="0" marL="0"><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="900" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="9AA8C7"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Calibri" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Calibri" pitchFamily="34" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="Calibri" pitchFamily="34" charset="-120"/></a:rPr><a:t>SafeVision  ·  FYP 2025–26  ·  UET Lahore</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="900" dirty="0"/></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="21" name="Text 18"></p:cNvPr